@host = http://localhost:5253

### All customers
GET {{host}}/customers

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Linus Torvalds",
  "email": "linus@example.com"
}

### Same email again — 2601 from the unique index, surfaced as 500 (no error handling on purpose)
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Linus Again",
  "email": "linus@example.com"
}
